# site.env: settings for THIS host, kept out of git. Copy this file to
# site.env, chmod 600, and fill it in. Plain KEY=VALUE lines.
#
# What goes here: what differs between hosts or shouldn't be in git (the
# LAN address to bind, volume and backup locations, values your scripts
# feed into flk secrets). What doesn't: settings the app reads (flk.toml
# [env]), and secrets themselves (flk secrets set).
{{range .P.keys}}
{{.}}={{end}}
